// Skinwalker, guise (animal form): a lone female deer of whichever vanilla type lives in the region, in the more wooded part of its habitat.
// Tells: eyes set a little too far forward with a red catch-light, it never flees, it stands still and turns to face you.
// Per-type numbers are copied from vanilla deer-adult.json (1.22.7, female). Vanilla assets need the "game:" prefix here.
// Test-only for the JSON play-test: the spawn rules and the despawn behavior. The release build has neither; the Director
// takes them over. Spawn chance is per deer type, so a region where several types live gets more guises.
// AI: the Stalker AI's walkers-retreat, walkers-creep and walkers-stare (Walkers/Stalker) run while it has a victim; the vanilla
// idle, wander and look-around run while it has none. speedFactor scales stalk.guiseSpeed to each deer type's wander speed.
// getoutofwater stays above them all: it never swims.
